    answer: '- `PagingSource.load(params)` returns `LoadResult.Page` with data plus next/prev keys, or `LoadResult.Error`\n- `PagingData<T>` is the emitted container, delivered as a `Flow` from a `Pager`\n- `RemoteMediator` prefetches network pages into `Room` and owns the exhausted-cache boundary'
