    answer: '- Call sites plus the arguments each received are recorded in a slot table over a gap buffer\n- Compiled code tests incoming arguments against the stored ones with `==` and skips when they match\n- Only the scope that read a changed value invalidates; `@Stable`/`@Immutable` certify a type as safe to skip'
